<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;评分</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;评分</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/short-stories:00078/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>2005年8月19日，地点：忘川黄花畔</p>
<hr />
<p>在雏菊的芬芳中，<br />
<a href="/scp-cn-463">她</a>谢绝了小女孩的挽留。</p>
<p><a href="/scp-3448">小女孩</a>给她戴上茉莉花花冠，<br />
目送她踏上浩浩荡荡的水面，<br />
朝向远方<a href="/wanderers:the-travel-notes-of-qingming">返回</a>到暴风雨中。</p>
<p>但她无所畏惧，因为她现在，<br />
终于有力量能保护她的孙子了。</p>
<hr />
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;评论区&nbsp;1个</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;评论区</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4055881); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606333771" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4055881); return false;">Etinjat</a></span>：</strong>从归档处转来。在基金会中凡人基本上只有死去或者遭遇意外才能成为异常，有些感叹。另外，日期是当年的中元节。</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00078" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/short-stories:00078" target="_blank">编辑 &amp; 评论</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00078-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4055881); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606333771" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4055881); return false;">Etinjat</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1599476860 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 Sep 2020 11:07</span></p>
</div>
