<blockquote>
<p><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/misaya1" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5393648); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5393648&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606333772" alt="Misaya1" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5393648)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/misaya1" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5393648); return false;">Misaya1</a></span>：</strong>能稍微解释一下吗？我的意思是，似乎有点太过朦胧了</p>
